	(text "SYS-007 / PWR-006: SOURCE SUPERVISION / U11, R32-R34, C67-C71\nVtrip=Vref*(1+R32/R33)+Isense*R32.\nNominal=0.405*(1+732k/100k)=3.369600V.\nVref +/-2%, Isense +/-25nA; each R +/-0.1%, 25ppm/C, 100C.\nCorner trip=3.263705831..3.476597632V.\nC68: tau=(732k||100k)*1n=87.980769us (nominal).\nC69-C71: 3x100n C0G; initial/temp=284.145..316.827nF.\nCT delay=300/175+0.0005=1.714786s nominal.\n0.6*(284.145/175+0.0005)=0.974511s MODEL, not guarantee.\nRequire qualified reset hold >=0.90s >650ms KILL blank +10ms.\nR34=110k: ENhigh>=2.7-3.8uA*110k*1.01^2=2.273598V.\nPOR sink=(1.3-0.2)/(110k*0.99^2)+3.8uA=14.003041uA.\nMAIN_PWR_EN drives raw U16 buffer; held Q3 clamps TPS63806 EN.\nHeld U12 also drives KILL/discharge; USB-clear still needed.\nCurrent EN network and rail calculations: PWR-006.\nSources/Python: design/system_power_design.md SYS-007;\ndesign/main_regulator_tps63806.md PWR-006. Reset coordination: #846."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 228.346 172.466 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/main_regulator_tps63806.md")
		)
		(uuid "7a202d46-44e4-4f45-ab78-e76c406a4359")
	)
	(text "SYS-007 / PWR-004: HELD SUPPLY / U10, R31, C62-C66\nC63-C66: 4 x 100uF/10V; Cmin=400uF*0.9^3=291.6uF.\nVIN=raw SYS; VOUT->R31->reservoir; CE senses reservoir.\nIcontrol<=1.125mA incl 500uA bank leakage allocation.\nPre-trip reverse: 80mV/98.01ohm<0.817mA. Itotal=1.942mA.\nVinitial=3.263705831-max(0.250,0.001125*102.24)\n        =3.013705831V (threshold OR resistive-drop limit).\nt_hold=[291.6uF*(3.013705831-2.7)V-1uC]/1.942mA\n      =46.589403ms >38.997458ms shutdown at 1mF.\nKey-return-aware hold margin=7.591945ms at 1mF.\n1uC covers initial undershoot + reverse/gate transitions.\nQualify VIN=0..4.6V, slow/floating-source collapse and load.\nR31 short: 4.6^2/98.01<0.216W; 1W nominal rating.\nControl only: no MCU/audio/display loads on AON_HOLD.\nSeparate unadopted eFuse extra load is not included.\nSources/Python: ../design/system_power_design.md SYS-007;\n../design/main_regulator_ltc3119.md PWR-004."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 228.6 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/main_regulator_ltc3119.md")
		)
		(uuid "807d8433-1b44-4fce-9ef1-4800bfe8bc6b")
	)
	(text "SYS-007 / PWR-004: SHUTDOWN / U12, Q1-Q3, R35-R40, R70-R71\nPOWER_OFF_H=NOT(MAIN_PWR_EN); held-domain VCC=2.7..4.6V.\nEach gate branch: 1k series / 1M pulldown; 1% + 100ppm/C, 100C.\n4-gate peak<=4*4.6/(1000*0.99^2)=18.773595mA <50mA.\nIncludes future USB-clear; static<=22.773595uA <100uA.\nVGSmin=(2.6-1020.1*1uA)/(1+1020.1/980100)=2.596278V.\n1uA per gate/board leakage is a qualification allocation.\nRUN/KILL/discharge/USB-clear FET drains remain separate.\nR39||R40 + Q2: Rmax=22*1.01^2/2+0.2=11.4211ohm.\nKey-filter return allocation Ir=1.5mA; R=Rmax.\nTotal=10ms+R*C*ln((3.6-Ir*R)/(0.3-Ir*R)).\nAt 850uF: 34.647839ms; at 1mF: 38.997458ms <46.589403ms.\nEach 22R: P<=3.6^2/(22*0.99^2)=0.601052W; 1W at 70C.\nQualify 0.2ohm FET, 10ms TOTAL response, derating and backfeed.\nGate/transient charge shares the existing 1uC reserve.\nVBATT firmware/option invariant remains unimplemented; #846 unresolved.\nSources/Python: ../design/system_power_design.md SYS-007;\n../design/main_regulator_ltc3119.md PWR-004."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.546 241.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/main_regulator_ltc3119.md")
		)
		(uuid "8e71e7e1-2c72-4bc7-a91e-b14475a13c76")
	)
	(text "ERC supply path: U10 VOUT through R31.\nPWR_FLAG declares that series-fed source only;\nraw SYS_AON source remains unimplemented."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330.2 73.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "917f2fb0-bc68-4027-a457-2f08586aca5f")
	)
	(text "INCOMPLETE POWER CONTROL - NOT FOR FABRICATION\nPB, INT, KILL, held supply and source supervisor are connected.\nU12/Q1/Q2 provide fault KILL clamp and main-rail discharge.\nMAIN_PWR_EN feeds raw U16; held Q3 separately clamps U13 EN.\nSYS_AON source and USB permission-latch clear remain to be built.\nCurrent converter: U13 TPS63806; design/main_regulator_tps63806.md PWR-006.\nMCU reset: design/reset_coordination_tps3890.md RST-002.\nRadio release margin and system shutdown coordination remain open (#846)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 228.6 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/main_regulator_tps63806.md")
		)
		(uuid "afa27a53-5a4f-4b8c-86d1-ba4f95138af6")
	)
	(text "BTN-003: POWER-KEY INPUT / R18, R19, C56, SW1\nR18=10k; R19=1k; C56=100nF. SYS_AON screen=3.0..4.6V.\nR bounds: nominal*(0.99*0.99)..nominal*(1.01*1.01).\nAt PB=0.6V: Isource<=(4.6-0.6)/9801 + 15uA + 12uA\n<435.13uA; Isink=0.6/(1020.1+0.5)>587.88uA.\nThus the closed switch pulls PB below its 0.6V falling threshold.\nMin contact current=3/(10201+1020.1+0.5)-12uA>255.34uA.\nOpen contact>=2.87748V; SW1 minimum rating=10uA at 2V.\nC56 discharge peak<=4.6/980.1<4.694mA < SW1 50mA rating.\n12uA is a leakage ALLOCATION; ESD/transient validation required.\nFull derivation + Python: ../design/single_button_power.md BTN-003/005/010."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 114.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bd9d6b7a-5ac8-470a-8918-e857e43f19e2")
	)
	(text "BTN-004: HARDWARE FORCED-OFF TIMING / C57\nC57=1uF; TDK C2012X7R1E105K125AB, 25V X7R +/-10%.\nC[uF]=1.56e-4*(t_added[ms]-1).\nt_force,nom=64ms + 1ms + 1/1.56e-4=6475.256ms (6.48s).\nC tolerance/temp only: 1*0.90*0.85=0.765uF;\n1*1.10*1.15=1.265uF -> 4.969..8.174s using NOMINAL IC equation.\nNot guaranteed timing: excludes IC spread, DC bias, aging, leakage.\nONT intentionally open: internal turn-on debounce=26..41ms.\nRelease the initial ON press; after forced off, release then press again.\nFull calculation + Python: ../design/single_button_power.md BTN-004/005."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
