		(property "Selection_Basis" "SYS-007 revised: four parallel 100uF/10V tantalum capacitors after R31. Cmin=400uF*0.9^3=291.6uF. Icontrol<=1.125mA plus 0.817mA pre-trip reverse allowance; initial Vhold=Vtrip_min-max(0.250V,Icontrol*102.24ohm)=3.013705831V. With combined <=1uC transition/initial-undershoot reserve, hold to 2.7V=46.589403ms. Qualification allocations, not measured guarantees; include raw VIN=0 and slow/floating-source collapse. Full math: ../design/system_power_design.md SYS-007."
